grounding.quote:
- user acceptance proves the outcome from the user's supported frame;
- end to end proves the complete authoritative runnable Product path;
- integration proves material participant composition; and
- unit proves module-owned laws, with evidence size and strategy proportional
  to their internal combinatorial complexity.

A missing owner projection is
an assurance or design gap. The independent oracle judges the acquired subject;
the implementation under test need not be trusted as that oracle.

- Goals or admitted work authority owns bounded work selection;
- Product owns Product-wide capability or acceptance meaning;
- requirements own constitutional behavior;
- accepted design owns realization structure and specialist design frames;
- identity and release owners retain their declared decisions; and
- an explicitly bounded proxy acts only inside its existing grant.

This profile is misapplied when:

1. Executive, Worker, or Reviewer is treated as a persona without a declared
   evaluation and authority relation;
